Z||000022||My7Fieros||09-13-2001||02:14 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by johnt671:<BR><B>That's sad.  Saw an even worse event on our local new last night.  A psychology dick from a local collage (won't name because I'm not sure I heard it right) said the attack was our fault because we are bullys and the terr. had no choice but to attack us.  Made me feel like the time we found an NVA headquarter in caves with better medical supplies than we had.  Along with this we found letter from Berkley Collage in CA telling the NVA they hoped they found the supplies useful in their war against the fascist Americans. Felt the same way when I saw and heard this pond scum.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>You have got to be kidding. Take this jerk and all the extreme hippy-types, and send them to the middle east. <I>Then</I>we bomb them.<P><P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I>||||reg||1
Z||000023||Fierowrecker||09-15-2001||07:17 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DRH:<BR><B>Not to excuse them... I'm sure many really ARE selfish jerks... I believe some people have gone into emotional overload though and HAVE to have a break from it. Some of what you saw could be that.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I can relate to that...<BR>My wife wondered why I shut down and did not want to look at it...<BR>Brings back too many bad memories...<BR>And it is also hard dealing with the anger...<BR>Stress, the reaction caused by the brain overriding the bodies desire to kick the living $hit out of some a$$hole that really deserves it!||||reg||1
